window.products.push({"id":1057028,"name":"GMOEGEFT Sweet Honey Bee Gnome Lights, Scandinavian Bumble Bee Gnome Elf, Swedish Tomte Nisse with Stripe and Bee Pattern Spring Summer Home Decoratio","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Z+kYaaT2L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"WARM LIGHTED GNOME - Bee gnome couple with lighted bodies will brighten your home and warm your heart all year round especially in summer. It is very easy and safe to decorate. 3 ”AAA” batteries are required when you want to light up the gnomes (not included in the package). LIGHT SETTING - There are 2 modes of these gnome lights. Turn the switch “ON” to keep the light up,or choose “OFF” to light off the gnomes. (There are no “TIMER” switches of this gnome set.) EXQUISITE WORKMANSHIP - The naughty gnomes play into bees, dressing up bees’ cloth with bendable antennas and adorable hind wings. It is very funny and festive. Each bee gnome is handcrafted, carefully sewing with attention and love. There are safety screws on the battery compartments, making them more sturdy and safe to use. 2 styles to meet your demands of gift exchange and home decoration. ABOUT GNOME - Gnome, which is also called Tomte, or Nisse. It is part of Scandinavian mythology. According to Scandinavian folklore, they usually hide from humans and use magic. They are reputed to safeguard the farmer and his family against any misfortune, especially during the night. The physical appearance of a tomte is considered to be extremely short and elderly with a long beard. SIZE & MATERIAL - 9.44 inches tall from bottom to top of hat, and 6.29 inches wide. The gnomes’ bodies are made by polyester fabric. Their noses are crafted from wool felt and the beards are made of cozy faux fur. The high caps include wires, and you can pose them in any way you like. The plastic bases are weighted, so that they can stand by themselves.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Z+kYaaT2L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"GMOEGEFT","source_asin":"B08T72TGHN","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1057028","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08T72TGHN","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08T72TGHN","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
