window.products.push({"id":1057135,"name":"Juicer with Titanium Enhanced Cut Disc, GDOR Dual Speeds Centrifugal Extractor Machines with 2.5\" Feed Chute, for Fruits and Veggies, Anti-Drip, Inclu","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":39.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71lzU+8b-EL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Better Juice, Healthier Life - The GDOR Compact Juicer with 2.5\" Feed Chute saves prepare time. Maximum power 600W strong motor and enhanced titanium blades process foods in just seconds. Besides, a 15 oz juice jug and a cleaning brush are both included! [Reinforced Titanium Disc] - Enhanced titanium blades disc of the juice extractor is perfect for cutting harder foods like apple, celery, carrot, kale and others. Micro mesh filter is made out of culinary grade stainless steel, with the disc together are designed for optimum juice and nutrient extraction. [Dual Speeds System] - Fruit juicer with dual speeds system gives you full control over the softest or hardest fruits and veggies. \"Ⅰ\" low speed is for soft fruits like oranges, tomatoes and others; \"Ⅱ\" fast speed is for hard fruits like apple, celery, carrot, kale and others. [Shorten Prep Time] - The juicer has a 2.5 inch wide chute feed, shorten pre-cutting time. Easy installation, each part is sturdy and it can be installed in just several steps, which is friendly for young and old. All designs are for you and your family to drink healthy juice faster. [Built-In Foam Separator] - It is normal for certain fruits or vegetables to foam while juicing at high speed. The juice jug features an integrated a built-in foam separator to pour more juice into the glass, reducing clogging and foaming. [Safety Features] - Safety buckles prevent the juice maker from operating without the lid locked into place. Overload and overheat protection will automatically shuts down juicer, ensure safety and extend service life. ETL listed juicer includes key safety features. All materials are culinary grade and BPA-Free, which also ensure the high quality and long service life. [Easy to Clean] - Equip a special brush to make cleaning easier and faster. All removable parts of the juicer are dishwasher (Top Shelf Only) safe and can be rinsed directly with water. While you are still enjoying the juice, parts has been cleaned well. [Life Time Service] - GDOR has a professional after-sales service team, who provide life time service. Just try it risk-free! Our total satisfaction promise covers all our products. In the unlikely event that you don’t satisfied, will offer you a replacement or a full refund. [Tips Before the 1st Time Use] - In order to improve the performance and experience of the electric juicer, we recommend running the machine 2 times without any food for one min each before using it for the first time. [Tips While Using] - Do not operate the juicer continuously for more than 10 minutes. Allow the motor to rest for 20-30 minutes to cool down after a 10 minutes operation. In this way, service life of this machine will be prolonged, the machine will serve you more efficiently.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71lzU+8b-EL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"GDOR","source_asin":"B0C7BTZBQ8","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1057135","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C7BTZBQ8","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C7BTZBQ8","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
