window.products.push({"id":1057261,"name":"Green Three Legged Toad Money Frog Statue","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/418jw7N2-LL._AC_.jpg","description":"Fortune toad or money toad is used for attracting luck, wealth and abundance. It can often be seen near cash registers, receptions, managers' desk, computers and offices. This mythical creature is said to appear during the full moon, near houses or businesses that will soon receive good news and good fortune. According to Feng Shui beliefs, fortune toad helps attract and protect wealth, and guards against bad luck. Since it symbolizes the flow of fortune, Feng Shui expert insists that a fortune statue should not be positioned facing the main door (\"outward\"). It also \"should never be kept in the bathroom, bedroom, dining room or kitchen\" Each fortune holds a ancient coin in its mouth. The coin can be removed and replaced with coins from different countries as seen in picture. It can be coin collectors. Unique gift for business people, realtors, bankers, stock agents and investors to attract more wealth!!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/418jw7N2-LL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"C.N.","source_asin":"B006AKP5AO","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1057261","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B006AKP5AO","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B006AKP5AO","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
