window.products.push({"id":1057327,"name":"Electric Can Opener 2.0 Portable Safety Can One Press to Open with a Manual Can Opener, 2.7*1.6*6.9in","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":16.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41m1wgmkycL._AC_.jpg","description":"Operating the Electric Can Opener 1Place the Can Opener on top of the can with its rim positioned in the groove between the Cutter and the Drive Wheel. 2With the can on a flat surface, press the Button for about one second and release, then the Can Opener will start cutting the side of the can. 3When the cutting has completed, press the button immediately to reverse the cutter. 4Make sure that the cutter resets to the start position and the motor stops. Then, lift the can opener off the can, the magnet on the Automatic Can Opener will also pick up the lid. How to open the battery compartment? 1. Press and hold a mini button at the bottom of the pointed end, and at the same time divide the entire upper and lower parts into two forces, push the upper part forward, and the upper and lower parts will be separated. 2. Insert two AA batteries and it is ready to use. specifications Size: 2.7*1.6*6.9in Weight: 0.36 lb Maximum cutting size: 3.5'''' (90mm) diameter Package includes Electric can opener*1 Manual can opener*1 Can opener manual *1 Warm tips: 1. If the battery is exhausted, pressing the button may not release the jar. Remember to replace the battery. 2. If the can is stuck, press the black button at the end of the can opener. Rotate it in the opposite direction to release the can. 3. If the can opener is stuck on the can, you need to press the metal button to restore the blade. 4. Jars with heavy seams and uneven edges may block the can opener. If this happens, follow the steps above to release the canister. ''","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41m1wgmkycL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Generic","source_asin":"B0B643ZZLD","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1057327","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B643ZZLD","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B643ZZLD","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
