window.products.push({"id":1057475,"name":"3 Cup Electric Mini Garlic Chopper, Garlic Masher Blender Mini Food Processor, Garlic Mincer Pepper Chili Vegetable Nuts Meat Grinder, Mincer Blender ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81D+WNY-8dL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Luxury Set, Meet All Your Needs: Package come with 1*motor head, 2*250ML cup, 1*100ML cup, 3*blades, 1* USB cable, 1* user manual. Multi-size cups meet all your needs, it fitted with a 30W motor designed to drive 3 stainless steel reinforced blades that provide great performance for reliable results. A Great Helper in the Kitchen: As a compact and lightweight electric garlic chopper, this 8.5oz food chopper is perfect for small jobs, like chopping garlic, ginger, peppers, carrots, vegetables, onions, breadcrumbs,nuts and more. Waterproof and Easy to Clean: The whole body of our garlic mincer is waterproof, cleanup is a breeze. A quick swish in sudsy water with a quick brush and it is clean. Please notes that the blades of the garlic cutter are removeable and sharp while washing. Mini food processor so small and can keep it right in the cabinet, space-saving and ready for next use. Portable and USB Charging: Small size and wireless feature, make the electric garlic chopper so portable and convenient to use while no need to worry about the cable tangles. The rechargeable electric garlic masher support USB charging, handheld wireless mincer can be used about 35 times after full charged for 3 hours. 100% Satisfaction: Electric mini food chopper is a great device to take on picnic, family trip or vacation's where doesn't have a fancy food processor, allows for you to make healthy condiments that are fresh and delicious. If you are not satisfied with our electric mini chopper, please return it for full refunds.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81D+WNY-8dL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Star","source_asin":"B08L79SKJH","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1057475","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08L79SKJH","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08L79SKJH","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1057476,"name":"Polish Pottery Medium Round Baker with Handles made by Ceramika Artystyczna (Babcia's Garden Theme) + Certificate of Authenticity","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":44.82,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61p9t0tQLYL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Polish Pottery Medium Round Baker with Handles made by Ceramika Artystyczna, Babcia's Garden Theme Certificate of Authenticity and origin is included Dimensions: 2.05\" high, 8.11\" wide, 9.92\" long, (max. outside edge or handle) Capacity: 29oz (filled to the rim) Polmedia Polish Pottery Stoneware is: * Hand crafted and hand painted in Boleslawiec, Poland * Microwave safe, dishwasher safe, oven safe up to 480 F, freezer safe * Lead and cadmium free * Crack and chip resistant * Intended for everyday use, easy to clean * Highly collectable About Polish Pottery Polish pottery is known for its versatility in the kitchen and on the table. It is safe for use with food in the microwave, freezer, oven and dishwasher. Polish stoneware is resilient to abrasives making it durable and resistant to scratching or chipping. It distributes heat evenly for perfect baking and is also nonstick for easy clean-up, making it easy to care for. The bright patterns never fade, and are offered in thousands of variations to mix and match. It is this combination of function and beauty that makes Polish pottery so appealing. The pottery is fired in electric and gas kilns at temperatures exceeding 2200 degrees Fahrenheit. This results in a stoneware that is meant to resist aging and provide lasting beauty that stands the test of time. Polish stoneware is lead and cadmium free.Polish Pottery is hand crafted and hand painted in the Boleslawiec region of Poland. This region is famous for its naturally found white clay which artisans have used for centuries to craft this durable and beautiful stoneware. Each piece of pottery is carefully formed and painted by hand to ensure that exceptional attention to detail is paid to each piece. The most beautiful and intricate patterns are called UNIKAT patterns. These patterns bear the artist’s signature.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61p9t0tQLYL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Polmedia Polish Pottery","source_asin":"B08K9DZVX5","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1057476","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08K9DZVX5","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08K9DZVX5","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
