window.products.push({"id":1057483,"name":"Cook with Color Toaster, Stainless Steel 2 Slice Rounded, Wide Slot Toaster with 6 Browning and Toasting Levels, with Bagel, Defrost and Cancel Option","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91FGKG-2cOL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"ADD COLOR TO YOUR HOME: Accessorize your kitchen and countertop with this retro toaster featuring a sleek, dark grey, speckled design. Add simple style while toasting bread and bagels, making your morning that much brighter. HAVE YOUR TOAST ANY WAY YOU LIKE IT: Our 825-watt stainless steel toaster is designed to keep every family member happy. 6 browning levels, 3 easy push functions: defrost (use for frozen bread), bagel (one sided toasting function) and cancel (stop toasting whenever you want). MORE AWESOME FEATURES: Extra wide 1.5\" slots can easily fit thick slices of bread, bagels, waffles, or whatever you feel like toasting. Bread will automatically pop up when finished but lever can be lifted higher making it safer and easier to reach all sized slices. Our stainless steel quality toaster is designed to last and help you create beautiful memories while spending time with family and friends over casual breakfasts and lunches. EASY TO CLEAN AND STORE: No one likes greeting a messy toaster in the morning or the smell of burned crumbs. Our toaster has a removable crumb tray for easy cleaning, remove the tray and dump the crumbs to clean. When not in use, place the toaster’s electrical cord in the cord holder for easy storage. CUSTOMER SATISFACTION GUARANTEE - At Cook with Color, our #1 goal is customer satisfaction, please feel free to reach out to us so we can ensure that your Cook with Color order experience is positive and hassle free.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91FGKG-2cOL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"COOK WITH COLOR","source_asin":"B09BP6F4JL","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1057483","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09BP6F4JL","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09BP6F4JL","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
