window.products.push({"id":1057556,"name":"Ceramic Coffee Travel Mug | Reusable Coffee Cup with Lid |12oz Tall Size | Green & Groovy Cups (Aqua)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/715RR4BPVhL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Meet your new best friend - from Green & Groovy Cups! You'll love hanging out with this cute reusable coffee cup each and every day whilst doing your bit for the environment. This sturdy ceramic cup feels beautiful to hold and makes your daily coffee even more of a treat. If your favorite drink is particularly hot, the silicone sleeve will protect your fingers. The silicone lid slips easily on and off; you can choose to use the lid or not! This reusable to go cup is designed to replace single-use paper coffee cups so please use it in the same way; except, of course, don't throw it away when you are finished; you can keep this coffee cup forever! The coffee tumbler is 12oz / 350ml or the equivalent of a tall size coffee. Your local barista will love serving up your special brew in this unique coffee cup. If you commute by car to work, this travel coffee mug fits most standard sized car cup holders. The simple pleasure of a beautiful coffee cup with your special brew will make the trip a little more enjoyable. For easy washing, it is dishwasher safe. Although it's nice to enjoy your coffee freshly brewed, if you do need to reheat, it is microwave safe (but please remove the lid first). Green & Groovy Cups - reusable coffee cup with lid - makes a perfect gift for yourself or your loved ones. Enjoy! Here are some instructions on how to put the lid on. Let's call it the \"hand glide\". 1. Hold the lid in the palm of your hand with the sip hole at the base of your pinky finger 2. Place the pinky finger / sip hole part of the lid on the rim of the cup 3. Then in a smooth circular motion, glide your index finger around the top of the lid 4. It should make a little \"pop\" sound when the whole lid is in place Do this every morning with your fresh brew and it will be second nature before you know it!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/715RR4BPVhL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Green & Groovy","source_asin":"B07S1HHD1J","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1057556","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07S1HHD1J","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07S1HHD1J","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
