window.products.push({"id":1057906,"name":"Blooming Fields Dried Pampas Grass Decor - 75-Pack Natural Pompous Grass 17\" Tall Small Pompas Floral Boho Flowers Large Bouquet - 20 x White Pampass ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":19.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81MysuWcJ1L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"✔️[WELL-BALANCED LARGE BOUQUET] The 75-Pack Blooming Fields dried pampas grass decor tall is the rising star among dried flowers. Our boho style pompous grass is the perfect fit for a connoisseur's home, event, or even wedding. This premium boho flowers package includes 20 PCS white pampas grass, 20 PCS brown pampas grass 20 PCS horsetail, and 15 PCS bunny tail pampass. This pampass assortment is the best choice among other options of dried flowers for vase. Choose our dried flower bouquet. ✔️[ GET A GREAT BLOOMING EFFECT ] Our fluffy pampas grass produces little to no shedding, unlike others. Using a hair spray will strengthen the fibers of the pompas grass even more. Pro tip: Leave the pompas floral arrangements for 2 hours under the sun for a fluffy and glowing effect. You can get the same fluffy effect by using a hairdryer for only 2 minutes. Enjoy the Blooming Fields pampas grass plants, including the white, brown, reed, and bunny tails dried flowers. ✔️[ WHY CHOOSE US? ] You're probably looking for the best bouquet. There are options like artificial pampas, other dried plants, faux pampas grass, or even tall pampas grass for floor vase. Why natural? A small pampas grass is a great way of expressing elegancy. This classy bouquet is the ideal gift. Unlike large pompass grass branches, this is a delicate way of expressing love and joy. Embrace nature and spread love. Decorate your harmony. :) ✔️[ EXQUISITE AND CLASSY ] With colors like brown, cream beige, white, or gold, our short pampas grass will bring a splash of color to your home. The 4 species of papas grass offer a pleasant diversity. The mini pampas grass can be put in a single vase or distributed in 2 to 4 vases. The wheat grass decor will impress all the guests. The Blooming Fields pompus gras will not go unnoticed. Enjoy the best decorative grass in the comfort of your home or offer it as a gift. ✔️[ 100% MONEY BACK GUARANTEE ] We’re dedicated to offering the best pampass grass products to decorate your home or event. We made sure to harvest the highest quality dry pampas grass, but if for ANY reason you are not satisfied, you will receive a refund, no questions asked. Click on the \"Add to Cart\" button NOW and decorate your home now!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81MysuWcJ1L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Blooming Fields","source_asin":"B0C1KQLH4G","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1057906","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C1KQLH4G","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C1KQLH4G","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
